    <entry id="engine_announce_tagline"><![CDATA[The old machinery stirs anew]]></entry>
    <entry id="engine_announce_body"><![CDATA[{colour_start|engine_announce_accent}DDX{colour_end} now runs beneath this estate. It is an engine library: it reaches into the game itself to give mods what data files alone cannot, from new kinds of items and equipment slots to richer tooltips, combat triggers and the expedition log.]]></entry>
    <entry id="engine_announce_body_2"><![CDATA[The mods that rely on it need nothing more from you. Keep {colour_start|engine_announce_accent}Darkest Dungeon Extender{colour_end} applied to this campaign beside them.]]></entry>
    <entry id="engine_announce_mods"><![CDATA[Built upon it in this game]]></entry>
